speechtext:
1.	Did the Department of Veterans Affairs recently hold a conference of district administrators D.V.A. and district superintendents V.L.A.?
2.	If so, where and when was the conference held;
(a)	who presided; (b) what was the duration; (c) how many attended?
3.	What was the total cost of (a) transportation;
(b)	hotel and living expenses?
